window.products.push({"id":296227,"name":"UMLo Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 25Kpa Lightweight Stick Vacuum with Powerful Suction Brushless Motor, Rechargeable Cordless Vacuum, 40 Mins Max Runtime,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-k-aBQ6ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🏡【POWERFUL SUCTION & BRUSHLESS MOTOR】With 235W brushless motor, UMLo cordless vacuum cleaner provides 25KPa max powerful suction power. This stick vacuum can capture debris, dust, crumbs, pet hair, pet food, cat litter, and other messes on various surfaces with ease, including hardwood floors, low-pile carpets, tile, marble, rugs, stairs, or any other surface 🏡【DETACHABLE LONG-LASTING BATTERY & LARGE DUSTBIN】This cordless stick vacuum comes with a detachable long-lasting battery that features 6 cells and has a large capacity of 2200 mAh, provides up to 40 mins runtime on eco mode, and 16 mins on Max mode. With a large capacity battery and 1L large dustbin, this rechargeable household vacuum cleaner can clean the whole house on a single charge, perfect for daily quick cleaning 🏡【LIGHTWEIGHT DESIGN & MULTI-FUNCTION】With an ultra-lightweight main motor(2.4 lbs), multi accessories, and extendable tube, this wireless vacuum cordless is versatile enough to meet all your daily cleaning needs, from cars to beds, furniture, curtains, sofas, corners, and more. Whether you live in a house, apartment, RV, or dorm, a lightweight vacuum is the perfect cleaning solution for all your floor-to-ceiling cleaning needs 🏡【FLEXIBLE LED MOTORIZED FLOOR BRUSH & LED DISPLAY】This hardwood floor vacuum is equipped with a flexible LED motorized floor brush that features a V-shaped 2-in-1 brush roller, which is perfect for hard floors and short-pile carpets. Flexible 180° swivel and 90° up and down allow the vacuum cleaner cordless for cleaning in all directions. 4 LED headlights help illuminate every dark area to track dust. The LED display also makes it easy to check the suction level and battery 🏡【HIGH-EFFICIENCY FILTRATION SYSTEM】With advanced multi-stage filtration system, combined with the special multi-cone cyclone design, the stick vacuum cleaner cordless enable to capture up to 99.99% of particle dust as small as 0.1um, reducing the HEPA filter cleaning times and providing ultimate purified air. This carpet vacuum cleaner is friendly to families with pets, children, or the elderly. Note: HEPA is unwashable, attached has an extra HEPA as a backup 🏡【ONE CLICK EMPTY & EASY STORAGE】One click to quickly empty the dust cup without getting your hands dirty. The wall-mount design can store your vacuum cleaner cordless and accessories, keeping your home neat and organized. Each UMLo vacuum cleaner comes with a 12-month professional after-sales service, so you can feel confident in your purchase and know that you're getting the support you need. Perfect gift choice for yourself, your family, and your friends","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-k-aBQ6ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UMLo","source_asin":"B0C5LNXYJQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-296227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5LNXYJQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5LNXYJQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
