window.products.push({"id":296306,"name":"Dream Catcher|Star Dream Catcher, Handmade Macrame Wall Hanging Bohemian Dreamcatcher for Home Decor, Room Decor, Wall Décor, Ornament Craft Gift(Star","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QhT4yn53L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⭐【SYMBOLIC MEANING OF DREAM CATCHERS】A legend has it that when you hang up the dream catcher around your head at night, the woven net helps to filter dreams and brings you into sweet dreamland, while the nightmare has been caught and disappeared with the morning sun, what a wonderful wish! ⭐【Creative Art Decoration】Handmade woven dream catcher wall décor designed with Star shape, its above flying one crystal star pendants; the below woven pattern comes with little crystal stars, and tassels around its end, make it gleamingly twinkle under the light. ⭐【Superior Quality】100% handmade! The star dream catcher consist of metal circle, nature cotton threads and the high quality wood beads, eco-friendly and no smells natural material help dream catchers stays bright for years to come and never fade even hung by long time. ⭐【Best Size】Star shape total Length is around 31 inch/ 78cm, Diameter is approx 7 inch/ 18cm.A perfect size can be easily hung in from walls, windows and ceiling to fill your blank bed rooms and living rooms, studio, office and even garden, a pretty macrame dreamcatcher decoration for party, celebration and wedding! ⭐【Great Gifts】The original Bohemian creates the unique art styles that classical and stylish, it's not just your best choice for home decoration, but also lovely gifts for friends, parents, partners and kids as their Christmas, birthday, Valentine’s Day and Children's Day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QhT4yn53L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HmiL-U","source_asin":"B08LD5V7FS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-296306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LD5V7FS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LD5V7FS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":296307,"name":"SEEYE Zebra Shade Blinds Horizontal Window Curtain Day and Night Blind Dual Layer Shades Easy to Install 31.5\"×59\", Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XLj3zjfRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Safety design: Our zebra curtains are safer than other vintage zebra blind because we have chain wall connectors. You can attach the connector to the wall. It avoids the safety hazards of all children and pets. Unlike other spring roller mechanisms, the free stop runs as expected. Just pull it up gently. Curtain fabric: Our window blinds are made of high-quality breathable fabric, consisting of a transparent mesh and an opaque fabric, designed as horizontal stripes. 100% high quality polyester, good breathability, anti-static, dustproof and durable. Provide privacy while still allowing light to enter the room so you can control any time that requires privacy.Whether it is day or night, you can meet your requirements. Installation and measurement: Our zebra shades are suitable for both internal and external installations. Easy to install, with instructions. For internal installations, a window frame depth of at least 2 inches is required. Please also note that the curtain width is for the total curtain width, including the hardware space installed on each side (1.5 inches total, 0.75 inches per side), not just the width of the fabric. Simple cleaning: Our day & night blinds suitable for kitchen, bathroom, office, bedroom, garage, study, family room, nursery, etc. Use feather duster or clean with a soft brush or cold water, and it can be used for many years. Total Size: 31.5\"×59\", adjustable length from 0 to 59\". If you have any questions about size selection and using, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XLj3zjfRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEEYE","source_asin":"B0BVT87JNH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-296307","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVT87JNH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVT87JNH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
