window.products.push({"id":296311,"name":"Vintage Sunflower Large Wall Clocks Decorative Modern for New Couple Housewarming Gift Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510PIAWlNIL._AC_.jpg","description":"Description: Made of wooden MDF, wood particle board painted, covered by paper drawing, various designs paper cover on MDF available. Add charm to any room in your home. AA battery is required for this clock (not included). Farm house and vintage wall wooden clock can be a good gift at housewarmings, weddings, and social gatherings. Instruction: 1. There is an instruction in the shipping box, if you have problem with the clock, please fix hands set with the instruction. 2. The clock is not framed, also no glass face as the cover. If hands touch each other, you can adjust the hands to avoid the hands touching. If the hands drop down, don't worry, they are just loose, just press hands tight on the core shaft to make the hands parallel, then the hands will not drop and will keep time. 3. Sometimes the movement is not work just for the wrong place of the second hand. The red second hand is too deep or too shallow will effect the movement. You can pull the red second hand out and then add it again, then clock work well. There are slight difference between the picture and the real item caused by light brightness. Because the batteries is limited by international transport, the battery is no contain, please pay attention.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510PIAWlNIL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moonluna","source_asin":"B0861YTSDS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-296311","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0861YTSDS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0861YTSDS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":296312,"name":"Naturoom Natural Linen Sheer Curtains for Bedroom/Living Room Textured Open Weave Linen Semi Sheer Curtain Drapes Light Filtering, Rod Pocket Window T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81evmx+TxBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Experience a new lifestyle If you are tired of boring traditional solid sheer curtains yet colorful sheer curtains too bold.Why not refresh your space with NATUROOM simple ombre curtains.They are sure to Wow any guests and your famlily. Ombre Design： Features an ombre design for an eye-catching and comtemporary look. Colors gently faded from dark to light instantly add a statement yet not too bold or loud - simplicity experience to your home even high-end architecture decor such as hotel,restaurant. Dark colors part also helps block some light for privacy. Special Linen Like Fabric Made of 100% faux linenette durable premium polyester fabric. Offers more privacy compared to normal sheers while still let natural light coming throgh. Multi Functions Perfect home decor for living room,dinning room,bedroom,party,wedding backdrops or even outdoor hotel office dorm use. Ready made to perfectly go with your blackout curtains,darkening curtains,velvet curtains,valances,valence scarf or any window treatment. Q: My window is 84 inches long. Which size should I choose? A: Hello, you can choose the size of 72, 84 and 95 to match your curtains according to the preferences of each person. If you want more light, we recommend that you choose 72 inches. The 84 inch curtains can just cover you Curtains. If you like    to add an extra curtain on the floor, we suggest you choose 95 inches. Q: Is the size 52 x 84 inches for each panel or 2 panels combined? A: Each panel is 52 x 84, combined width is 104inches, which is wide enough for a large living room window. Q: What type of rod to use? A: Any standard curtain rod will work.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81evmx+TxBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Naturoom","source_asin":"B08BZHMDDX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-296312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BZHMDDX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BZHMDDX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
