window.products.push({"id":296314,"name":"Jofran Nature's Edge Console Table, 50\" W X 18\" D X 30\" H, Acacia Finish, (Set of 1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":227.35,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X0VzAB20L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Breathtaking solid wood perfectly preserved in its most Natural state makes this live edge sofa table not only beautiful, but completely one-of-a-kind. Our artisans select slabs of acacia hardwood and then leave the Natural edge of the tree whole to create a truly stunning visual effect. This unique rectangular sofa table measures approximately 50'' Long by 18'' Wide as the Dimensions of each piece will be slightly unique due to the live edge. Sleek hairpin legs bring attention to the rich finish that makes every single inch of the hardwood grain stand out and look amazing. This sofa table will make a stunning addition to any home decor with a combination of modern design and Natural beauty. Available in Natural, Slate and Chestnut finishes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X0VzAB20L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jofran","source_asin":"B082DZJV8J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-296314","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082DZJV8J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082DZJV8J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":296315,"name":"MJSWHY 2Pack Fake Snow Blanket 3 x 8 feet Thickened Fake Snow Blanket,White Christmas Decorations Fluffy Artificial Snow Powder for Snowy Decoration, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71beFjR-DaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Christmas Decoration】: Snow is an indispensable element of Christmas. Our Christmas snow blanket will be an essential for white Christmas decoration. It will create a romantic winter snow scene and greatly increase the Christmas festival atmosphere. 【Enough to use】: You will get 2 pieces of 3 x 8 feet durable fake snow blanket. The durable fabric is 36inches x 8 feet long per pieces, which can be rolled up and stored, and allowing you to turn your entire home into a snow village for years. Whether you use it as a whole piece or cut it into small pieces, it is enough to meet your Christmas village decoration needs. [Thickened Design]: Our Christmas snow blanket adopts thickened design (2cm/0.78inches thick) to make it more fluffy and soft. It looks so much like real snow that you can step on it as if you were stepping on real snow. The fake snow is thick enough that kids can play on safely. This artificial snow is definitely the thickness you want。You don't have to worry about folding snow blankets, and your statues, photos, and other display items won't be easily toppled over. [Quality Assured]: Our fake snow blankets are soft with thicker felt and higher quality than other advertised artificial snow. While other snow backgrounds will only be slightly tugged, this Christmas instant snow is more durable and can withstand tearing, cracking and abrasion. The Christmas fake snow blanket is as white as real snow and will not turn yellow or gray. Moreover, they don’t give off an unpleasant smell . Rest assured, this fake snow is guaranteed to last more than one Christmas! [Wide range of applications]: Our snow blanket rolls can be covered on the lawn of the yard, on the roof, and under the Christmas tree, the Christmas village, on shelves, cloaks, tables and fireplaces! Bright white felt allows the ultimate creativity: adding tinsel, glitter, or confetti for hidden Christmas magic! You can also cut them into shapes you want to decorate other items. It is also a good choice as a winter stage prop. It’s a perfect fake snow blanket for your Christmas village, a fireplace snow blanket, or the perfect holiday background for your office.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71beFjR-DaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MJSWHY","source_asin":"B0B5N55LK1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-296315","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5N55LK1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5N55LK1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
