window.products.push({"id":296320,"name":"14 Inch California King Size Memory Foam and Innerspring Hybrid Mattress, Double-Sided flippable Plush Mattress with 2 Bonus Pillows, Medium-Soft, Bed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vBimPaV2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Durable Two-Sides Mattress】 The unique feature of our 14-inch mattress is the double-sided flippable design with 3 firmness levels available. You are able to wear the foams more evenly by turning and flipping periodically to extend the life of the mattress. The individually pocketed springs are situated between layers of foam, creating a sturdy core cushioned by soft, flexible padding for extra comfort. California-King size mattress measures in 72\" x 84\", compatible with most bases and frames. 【Suitable For All Seasons】 Made of premium Gel Aerofusion Memory Foam provides 4x better pressure relief than traditional memory foam, enables to offer support and improves the ability to regulate temperature. The cover of the mattress is made of trademarked ThermaCool material, keeping you cool during the summer months but warm during the winter months. This feature gives you great comfort in all seasons. Maximize the excellent experience of deep sleep at night with a breathable gel mattress. 【Skin-friendly Mattress】 You can sleep on this 14-inch mattress with confidence because all our beddings are CertiPUR-US certified to ensure performance and safety. The Fiberglass-Free FR inner cover provides a natural flame-resistant fire barrier without synthetic chemicals. With the healthy and skin-friendly sleep surface, making our mattress is a top choice for upscale home furnishings. The elegant innerspring hybrid mattress is a great gift for children, parents, or friends. 【Meet Diversified Needs】 This hybrid Mattress provides multi-layer of contoured support to meet everyone's different sleep needs. Choose your firmness preference: medium soft (4) and luxury firm (8) or medium firm (6) - soft on one side and firm on the other. The medium-soft mattress is a great choice for side sleepers who desire comfort around their hips and shoulders. With an ideal balance of softness and firmness, back, side, and stomach sleepers will love the medium firm or luxury firm. 【Easy To Install & Use】 The 14-inch memory foam and innerspring hybrid Mattresses, are manufactured in the Europe and packaged as a ready-to-ship mattress-in-a-Box, which are easy to set up. Simply unbox and unroll the mattress, expanding to its original shape within 48-72 hours. The removable and machine washable mattress cover is durable and easy to clean. With 30 years limited warranty makes the bed mattresses a great investment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vBimPaV2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Airdown","source_asin":"B0BNTK4TLX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-296320","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNTK4TLX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNTK4TLX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
