window.products.push({"id":296383,"name":"NOTHEIA Storage Cart 2-Tier, Bathroom Organization Slide Out Cart, Laundry Room Organization and Storage Utility Cart, Snack Cart with Wheels Thin Spa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51C0SIheb9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✯【Excellent Storage Solution】With the dimension of 12.7\"x16\"x8.7\", the narrow shelves can magically create more storage space and fit in any tiny gap. It is great for adding more storage space in small or crowded rooms. ✯【Super Mobile Style】The storage cart is flexible and super mobile. The shelves are removable and can be combined again as you want. The cart is equipped with smooth and sturdy wheels. You can take them out when you don't need them. Or you can take them with you when you need to dye hair or put makeups. It is compact, so it can easily fit in small rooms. ✯【Multiple Usage】This storage cart can be used to store and manage a lot of things. It can work in the kitchen room to store the food, seasonings or small tools you need at hand. It can be a decor in the bathroom storing the personal care products, candles and more bathroom essentials. Also it can occur in the bedroom to put makeups and so much more. There's no limit for your imagination. ✯【Extra Accessories - Hooks】Except for wheels, there are 4 removable side hooks accessible. Suitable for everything you need to store. The cart is also designed hallow-out. It is easy for you to clean it and it will not accumulate water so that keep things dry in storage. ✯【Stylish & Decorative】The plastic & stainless steel storage cart has a slim body and there are 3 colors to choose, black, white and gray. They are easy to fit any style rooms. It is not only functional but also can be decorative. If you add candles, colorful gemstones in it, it will make your bathroom smell good and look more comfortable. You can also put small plants or floral decors in it to make it a beautiful decor for the bedroom or living room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51C0SIheb9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOTHEIA","source_asin":"B09H6R3L6Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-296383","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H6R3L6Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H6R3L6Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
