window.products.push({"id":296422,"name":"Exclusive Home Cabana Solid Indoor/Outdoor Light Filtering Hook-and-Loop Tab Top Curtain Panel, 54\"x96\", Cloud Grey, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bZCWvHaKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Exclusive Home Cabana Solid Indoor/Outdoor Light Filtering Hook-and-Loop Tab Top Curtain Panels are designed to add style to any space. These polyester curtain panels offer a heavy-duty canvas like feel and are UV ray protected. Constructed with sturdy hook-and-loop fastened tab tops, these curtain panels are UV ray protected, and water resistant and can be hung on a curtain rod up to 1.5\" diameter. Perfect for blocking the sun, creating more privacy, or setting the mood in your indoor or outdoor living space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bZCWvHaKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Exclusive Home","source_asin":"B07HZGKYCM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-296422","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HZGKYCM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HZGKYCM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":296423,"name":"Portacool PAC2K482S 48-Inch Portable Evaporative Cooler, 20000 CFM, 4000 Square Foot Cooling Capacity, 2-Speed, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cPY+A9jtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Port-A-Cool PAC2K482S Portable Evaporative Cooling Unit Portacool PAC2K482S Portable Evaporative Cooling Unit The Portacool PAC2K482S Portable Evaporative Cooling Unit is one of most efficient ways to keep cool, indoors or out! The large airflow capacity allows for cooling that can cover up to 4,000 square feet, lowering the temperature 15 to 25 degrees. This unit has a 40-gallon capacity with a convenient garden hose connection. The PAC2K482S uses an all-natural tap water with no harmful refrigerants to keep indoor and outdoor spaces cool. Heavy-duty casters make it portable and easy to move. You can rely on the PAC2K482S for all your cooling needs during those hot months. It's ETL rated, cost efficient, and ready to operate, right out of the box. No assembly required. What is Evaporative Cooling? Remember the chill of getting out of a swimming pool on a hot day? That's evaporative cooling. Evaporative cooling units create this natural effect and provide a constant flow of cool, refreshing air into hot, uncomfortable environments. The heart of an evaporative cooling system is the evaporative pad. A pump pushes water over the pads and a fan pulls the air through the pads. The water evaporates within the pads and the air passing through the pads is cooled. This unit does not produce mist, promote rusting or wet surfaces. About Portacool Portacool products are manufactured in the USA. The company is recognized as an industry leader with Portacool products being respected in both the United States and international marketplaces. Technical Specifications Two speed settings, cord wrap and polyolefin casters Two speed settings, cord wrap and polyolefin casters Constructed of one-piece, rust free, leak proof polyethylene for tough environments Constructed of one-piece, rust free, leak proof polyethylene for tough environments Unit measures 86 inches by 74 inches by 36 inches Unit measures 86 inches by 74 inches by 36 inches Unit weighs 345 pounds Unit weighs 345 pounds An All-Natural and Energy Efficient Cooling Technique Evaporative cooling units use regular tap water and 120-volt power with no harmful refrigerants. It is easy to use and maintain, and you can use it in conjunction with an air conditioner to boost the cooling. Evaporative cooling units are highly effective in climates where the air is hot and the humidity is low. In dry, arid climates, the use of evaporative cooling is more cost effective than traditional cooling methods. Evaporative Cooling UnitsPACKA34PACKA43PACKA77PACKA54PACKA55 Adjustable Speed Settings ✓✓✓✓✓ Low Water Alarm ✓✓ Remote Control ✓✓✓✓✓ Timer ✓✓✓✓✓ Automatic Swing Louvers ✓✓✓✓✓","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cPY+A9jtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Portacool","source_asin":"B000TOWAZK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-296423","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000TOWAZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000TOWAZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
