window.products.push({"id":296481,"name":"Pom Pom Duvet Cover Set Queen Size White & Grey, Ultra Soft, Cozy, Breathable & Luxury Comforter Cover with Zipper Closure and Corner Ties, 120gsm Pre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TrRVK-sZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"[Pom Pom Fringe Design] – Gorgeous, elegant and chic pom pom anti-visual fatigue design, the cute & stylish handmade pom pom fringe duvet cover set makes your bedroom full of bohemian style, turn your bedroom to be a relaxing and cozy space. [All Season & Soft & Comfortable] – 100% washed microfiber fabric duvet cover set makes the ultra-soft and comfortable feeling. Our duvet cover set is long lasting, anti-wrinkle, anti-fading, anti-pilling, non-deforming after washed a number of times. The quality fabric is suitable for all season keeping you cool in the hot summer days and warm in the cold seasons. [White & Grey Reversible ] - Never tired of your bedroom style with REVERSIBLE design. Change it up from time to time and refresh your home with a new look. Change a color, change a mood! [Hidden Zipper & Corner Ties] - Thoughtful design for hidden zipper closure ensure you can get your duvet out & in easily; corner ties help to secure the comforter in the right place from slipping into a pile and keep you comfortable all night long. Saving your time and no sweat on the job of bedding change. [What You Can Get] - Queen size duvet cover set 5 pieces includes 1 Duvet Cover 90” x 90” + 2 Pillowcases 20” x 26” White + 2 Pillowcases 20” x 26” Grey. Comforter or duvet insert or pillow insert is NOT included in the set. [Easy Care] - Machine wash in cold water with a gentle cycle. With like color. Do not bleach. Do not dry clean. Tumble dry at low heat. Can be cool ironed if necessary. To protect the pom pom fringe, please use laundry bag or turn the duvet cover and pillowcase inside out when you wash the bedding set. Please wash before first use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TrRVK-sZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wisepick","source_asin":"B09CDX14JM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-296481","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CDX14JM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CDX14JM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":296482,"name":"White Wine Glasses Set of 6, 17 oz, Modern Elegant, True Czech Lead-free Durable Crystal Wine Glass","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SM4uLtAzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ELEGANT EXPENSIVE DESIGN OF THE MODERN STYLE - The stylishness of the stemmed wine glasses will seduce all lovers of minimalist and elegant simplicity. This wine glass set is well-detailed with the most modern design. GENUINE CZECH CRYSTAL GLASS - Made from high-quality crystal-clear glass of the purest transparency, these white wine glasses have unique subtle melodic sound. They feature a laser-cut and polished surface that gives a smooth feel in the hand alongside timeless elegance. FRUSTRATION-FREE PACKAGING - The thick protective gift box is specially designed to give extreme levels of protection in transit. Make sure that each wine glass is wrapped individually with bubble wrap checking that it is completely protected. Purchase with confidence knowing that your white wine glasses set of 6 will arrive safe in perfect condition. IDEAL PROPORTIONS - Due to the laser quality control employed in the production of wine glasses, their proportions are precise and unique, resulting in incredible stability and resistance to breakage, chips and scratches. The thin rim and wide bowl of the glasses emphasize the taste and quality of any white wine. VERSATILE - These white wine glasses are the ideal way to add a touch of class to any occasion, whether it's a formal reception, a mother’s day, weddings, a father’s day, christmas, birthday, a romantic dinner or a casual get-together with friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SM4uLtAzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UpNew Style","source_asin":"B0C2CNHSBN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-296482","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2CNHSBN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2CNHSBN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":296483,"name":"Geek Chef Air Fryer Toaster Oven Combo,16QT Convection Ovens Countertop, 4 Slice Toaster, 9-inch Pizza, whit Warm, Broil, Toast, Bake, Air Fry, Oil-Fr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gPUDLIrDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Satisfy Family Needs】- With a 16-quart capacity and 3-layer even cooking, this oven can cook up to 4 slices of bread, a 9-inch pizza, or a 700g of chicken wings, making it perfect for preparing family meals or holiday dinners. 【All-in-One Cooking】- The 4-knob operation (timer, temperature, function, speed) makes it easy to use for people of all ages. You can cook a variety of foods, such as cake, chicken, fish, pizza, steak, toast, and even fries, all with this multi-functional oven. 【Smart Cooking Experience】- Access 100+ video recipes through the app to try new dishes every day. The oven is made of stainless steel, making it durable and easy to clean. It's the perfect gift for family and friends. 【Even Cooking with 360° Hot Air】- Our air fryer oven uses 360° air convection technology to cook food evenly. The fan speed can be adjusted for the perfect crisp and delicious food with up to 75% less fat. 【Convenient and Service-Oriented】- This oven comes with a baking pan, air fryer basket, wire rack, and crumb tray. Geek Chef offers a 1-year warranty and 24/7 customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gPUDLIrDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Geek Chef","source_asin":"B0C6H2HGLC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-296483","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6H2HGLC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6H2HGLC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":296484,"name":"ACIPENSER Computer Desk with Storage Shelves 47 Inch Home Office Desk with 5-Tier Reversible Bookshelf Writing Study Tower Desk Industrial Modern Styl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FYOHA-48L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Flexible & Available Usage Option】Our home office desk with 5-tier bookshelf offers your spacious space to keep your office supplies, stationery or personal items within easy reach. Shelves could be exchanged on the left or right as your preference, in addition, the second tier shelf is adjustable, which can be disassembled to place a computer host based on your different needs. 【Spacious Working Station】Our computer desk is equipped with Desktop 47.50” L x 23.62” W, which can offer you spacious space for monitor, laptop, keyboard, drinks, books, plants and other documents. Besides, our home office desk also comes with Bookshelf 25.2”L x 9.5”W x 55.5” H, holding small things like books, documents, display, decorations, photo frames, etc. So that it offers ample space for home or office daily use. Especially, a baffle is designed on the top shelf to prevent items from falling. 【Durable & Sturdy Structure】Our computer desk is made with 0.6”thickness MDF board and 1” thickness Metal Frame. Also made with two extra X shaped metal support to ensure stability. The home office table can hold up to 110lbs, while shelves can hold up to 25lbs each shelf. Our modern desk is ANTI-SCRATCH, WATERPROOF and ANTI-SKIDDING. In addition, it is designed with adjustable leg pads from different height needs to keep the desk stable balance on the uneven floor and carpet. 【Multifunction & Multi-scene Use】Our home office desk with 5-tier shelves is a combination of computer desk, bookshelf and storage rack, can keep your office environment in order and make you work more efficiently. Our desk is suitable for study room, bedroom, living room and office, which can be used as a computer PC table, home office workstation, study writing desk, gaming desk or make-up desk. 【Easy Assembly & 100% Satisfied Service】Our study writing table only take around 30min to assemble. Necessary hardware and simplest instruction are included. You can install it by the installation instructions steps or our installation guide video. If you’ve any questions about our product, please do not hesitate to let us know. We always reply within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FYOHA-48L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ACIPENSER","source_asin":"B09VXV8B2J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-296484","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VXV8B2J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VXV8B2J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
