window.products.push({"id":296622,"name":"HENGWEI Viscose Sheets Queen, Queen Sheets Cooling, 100% Viscose Viscose Sheets, Silky Soft Breathable, Cool Sheets for Hot Sleepers, Deep Pocket Shee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ov038ndKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🛏HENGWEI Full Viscose Bed Sheets Set 4 Piece Included: 1 Flat Sheet; 1 Fitted Sheet; 2 Pillowcases. 🛏Deep Pocket Full Size Sheets：Fitted Sheet Stretched Up to 17 Inches.However, it is worth noting that the viscose fabric is very soft and breathable, and will not scratch the skin. However, one of its characteristics is that after washing, it will have a slight shrinkage, and the size will be reduced a bit. So we suggest that you buy a larger size product, which will be more suitable for your bed after washing. 🛏Why Choose Viscose Sheets:Viscose sheets are softer, cooler than satin sheets, even more breathable than cotton sheets, it is the most premium fabric of all. The porous structure ofViscose fiber determines that it has a superior performance in regulating the temperature of the human body, so it is a significant advantage of being warm in winter and cool in summer. 🛏Why Choose Viscose Sheets From HENGWEI: The HENGWEI brand has been founded for 27 years, we have mature and high-quality supply chain ensures our unshakable position in the field ofViscose fiber bedding. In addition, every buyer should pay attention to the fabric composition marked by the seller, although they will use theViscose sheet set as a selling point, in fact, the fabric composition is mixed with other fabrics. What is certain is that our Viscose sheet set fabric is Viscose. 🛏What You Should Care: We have tried our best to present the most realistic appearance of our bed sheets, but due to the different display screens you watch, there will be a slight color difference between the real object and the picture. We will be very apperciated if you can tolerate this small error and purchase with caution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ov038ndKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HENGWEITEXT","source_asin":"B09XV7HTNX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-296622","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XV7HTNX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XV7HTNX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
