window.products.push({"id":296738,"name":"3-in-1 Mini Portable Heater - Made for Indoor Use in Office/Desktop/Bedroom with Humidifier & RGB Lights (EDH-WDM)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dOJjopQkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"[𝟑-𝐈𝐍-𝟏 𝐏𝐄𝐑𝐒𝐎𝐍𝐀𝐋 𝐒𝐏𝐀𝐂𝐄 𝐇𝐄𝐀𝐓𝐄𝐑] - Switch between the device's heating function, humidifiying function, and night light settings to make the most of your purchase and experience. Tailor the heater to your exact needs without having to buy more than one product! [𝐖𝐀𝐑𝐌𝐓𝐇 𝐖𝐈𝐓𝐇𝐎𝐔𝐓 𝐓𝐇𝐄 𝐖𝐀𝐈𝐓] - Our heater's advanced PTC ceramic heating technology and efficiency will heat up spaces in only 3 seconds. Enjoy the heat in your bedroom, office, or preferred space in the click of a button. [𝐏𝐄𝐑𝐒𝐎𝐍𝐀𝐋 𝐔𝐒𝐄] - This heater performs best when close to the user and is not meant to warm an entire room or large space. Keep yourself warm without overspending on an oversized heater. Spend less on our compact heater and use 20% less energy than other small heaters while getting more use from its humidifier and lighting functions! [𝐒𝐈𝐌𝐏𝐋𝐄 & 𝐄𝐀𝐒𝐘] - Only three buttons are used to control all of the heater's settings. The first switches between 2 heating modes, the second switches between 2 lighting modes, and the third turns the humidifier on and off. Thanks to the heater's simple design, anyone can use it! [𝐒𝐀𝐅𝐄𝐓𝐘 𝐅𝐄𝐀𝐓𝐔𝐑𝐄𝐒] - A tip-over protection system is built in to automatically shut the heater off if it happens to fall over. Its high-quality design and materials ensure your safety during use. Additionally, the fan is kept at a low noise to prevent any distractions while studying, resting, and more. [𝐏𝐎𝐖𝐄𝐑𝐅𝐔𝐋 & 𝐂𝐎𝐌𝐏𝐀𝐂𝐓] - At 5.25x8.25 inches, its small and lightweight design makes it easy for anyone to handle. Move the heater from room-to-room with ease, staying warm wherever you choose to go. For harder-to-reach outlets, an extension cord is recommended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dOJjopQkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gorilla Gadgets","source_asin":"B0BLXQ4LKP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-296738","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLXQ4LKP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLXQ4LKP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
