window.products.push({"id":296762,"name":"SUPERJARE Pipe Shelf 4-Shelf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vTS6kD62L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Not a handyman? Don’t worry, a considerate instruction will provide you a particular reference! ANY TIPS? - Make sure you line up the pieces and use a level for the verticals! - The distance between 2 brackets depends on the length of one board. Measure your board and determine how much you want to hang off either side of the brackets. - In consideration of the board's bearing capacity, we suggest that the horizontal distance between the brackets is not longer than 35.4\". - Wipe the pipes and other parts with a wet cloth before installation, or install it with gloves. Or else there will be paint on your hands, but no worries, just clean it with water. SHIPPING LIST: - 2 x Brackets - Hardware Bag - An Instruction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vTS6kD62L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPERJARE","source_asin":"B07CXTXTGF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-296762","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CXTXTGF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CXTXTGF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":296763,"name":"J&M Design 2-Pack Sugar Dispenser & Shaker For Coffee , Cereal , Tea & Baking with Pour Spout and Lid for Easy Spoon Measuring Pouring - 7.5oz Glass J","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vOrRV3ZUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A spoonful of sugar is always close at hand with the J&M Design 2-Pack Sugar Dispenser. The top spout allows for easy, controlled pouring, making it perfect for coffee, cereal, fruit and more. The metal chrome accents make it great for countertop or table design & will also fit in perfectly with all your coffee bar accessories & essentials. The clear, BPA-free glass body shows just how much sugar is left and the lid twists off to reveal a generous opening for easy refilling. Product Features Free Flow Sugar with Each Pour Clear, Glass Body with BPA Free Plastic Spout 7.5 Ounce Capacity Great for Coffee, Tea, Cereal bowl, Desserts, and More! Easy Refill Dishwasher Safe for Easy Maintenance A NECESSARY PART OF YOUR MORNING AND EVENING When it's time to get the day going or you want to sit back and relax, a perfectly sweetened hot cup of your favorite beverage makes it all the better. With our Sugar Dispenser, you'll know you're getting just the right amount of sugar each time. ELEGANT DESIGN The clear glass body of our Sugar Dispenser and sleek shape will make it a key piece in your kitchen decor. Specifically designed to fit perfectly in your hand so you always feel extremely comfortable pouring.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vOrRV3ZUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BrainChainz","source_asin":"B08R71LCGM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-296763","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R71LCGM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R71LCGM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
