window.products.push({"id":296882,"name":"MALOUF Heavyweight Portuguese Flannel Sheet Set-100% Cotton Pill Resistant Bedding-King-Coffee, King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81678WNsEIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Expertly crafted in Portuguese mills, WOVEN flannel achieves the perfect balance between softness, warmth and durability. The brushed 100 percent cotton weave has a velvety soft touch that promotes cozy sleep while breathable cotton offers year-round comfort. The surface is slightly napped on both sides to retain warmth and give it the smooth hand known to high end flannel. This heavyweight flannel has a durable fiber structure that reduces pilling or excess lint to maintain the lush finish. This sheet set has a deep-pocket fitted sheet with a thick, full length elastic to accommodate thicker modern mattresses with a smooth, even fit. The flat sheet and pillowcases feature a hemstitch finish for a clean, classic look.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81678WNsEIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MALOUF","source_asin":"B0877Q55T5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-296882","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0877Q55T5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0877Q55T5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":296883,"name":"Sawdust City 4359a If Ever There is a Tomorrow Wooden Winnie The Pooh Sign, Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714wp-EpSGL._AC_SL1350_.jpg","description":"This is a solid wood sign with an inspirational Winnie the Pooh saying. Full saying: if ever there is a tomorrow when We're not together - there is something you must always remember. You are braver than you believe, stronger than you seem, and smarter than you think. . But the most important thing is, even if We're apart. . I'll always be with you. ~ Winnie the Pooh. Our signs are handmade from solid Knotty pine, painted, and distressed to create a warm, aged look. We do not use highly processed wood. Because of this, you can expect knots and minor imperfections that make each piece unique. Overall size is 18\"wx7\"hx.75\"D. There is a Routed Slot in back for hanging the sign. It will hang flush against your wall with no hardware to make scratches. Our most popular colors are available here, but Sawdust City LLC offers over 40 colors plus custom finish options.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714wp-EpSGL._AC_SL1350_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sawdust City","source_asin":"B01632T9KA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-296883","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01632T9KA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01632T9KA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
